      "content": "the problem is i've already talked to them and they just give me these scripted, vague answers. it's like they're trained to stonewall me. it doesn't feel like a mistake or a glitch, it feels targeted. like they're watching my specific account and waiting for me to make a move so they can trip me up. if they're actually trying to force me out, calling customer service isn't gonna do anything. i need to know how to protect myself. what can i do to stop them from completing this liquidation without tipping them off that i know what theyre doing?",
